# SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
# Samsung Q60T (Nike-L) - vendor init, research target only (never flashed).
# Contains only fixes that were measured under QEMU on the same Linux 6.6.162
# ARM32 kernel (Build 069) and therefore apply to the TV kernel as well.

# Build 069 Boot 6 / Build 070: Linux 6.6 has no ashmem driver (CONFIG_ASHMEM
# is ACK-only), so system_server dies with "Failed to create ashmem".
# libcutils uses memfd only when sys.use_memfd=true; system/core/rootdir/init.rc
# sets it to false, so force it back on whenever that happens.
on early-init
    setprop sys.use_memfd true

on property:sys.use_memfd=false
    setprop sys.use_memfd true
